cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Human–AI Monitor in your research, please cite it as 
below."
title: "Human–AI Monitor: Weekly Protocols on AI and Humanity Development"
abstract: >-
  An open tool for monitoring the development of Artificial Intelligence 
and
  Humanity across 12 symmetric axes (6 AI RSI axes + 6 Human HHI axes) 
plus
  geopolitics as a meta-layer. Publishes weekly protocols, tracks Gap 
Index,
  and provides a public API.
